<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/39/eng@/~cl_2> <https://schema.org/text> "is amended by inserting after section 7 the following Offence. 8. ( 1) Any person who uses or attempts to use any road, bridge or ferry in respect of which an order under section 2 has been made without payment of the tolls prescribed in the order shall be guilty of an offence and shall, on conviction, be punished with a fine of not less than two thousand ringgit and not more than five thousand ringgit."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/39/eng@> .
