<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/39/eng@/~cl_2__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Notwithstanding subsection (1) tolls due and payable by virtue of an order made pursuant to section 2 may be recoverable by action at law by the person so authorised under the said section."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/39/eng@> .
